    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Real goulash is a stew, not a sauce. The key is to brown the beef properly in batches and to add the paprika off the heat or on a very low flame -- it scorches in seconds and turns bitter. Everything else follows naturally." }]
      },
      {
